WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
Four soft glows settle on the walls and the table.

00:03.200 --> 00:08.500
The hand rises and drops. Music begins from the walls.

00:08.500 --> 00:16.500
Faster beats. The left palm rises. Colour floods the walls.

00:16.500 --> 00:24.000
A fist. The walls go dark. One bell. Your room is the hall.
